  <title>Invoice hub</title>

  <p>The invoice hub shows one invoice from every side, and changes nothing.
  It opens from <link xref="invoice_history"/>, <link
  xref="product_serial_numbers">serial numbers</link> and the ledger
  reports, wherever an invoice is listed.</p>

  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Metadata</gui></title>
    <p>Its dates (created, invoice date, printed and paid), its customer,
    type, totals and comments.</p>
    <p>Under <gui>Difference between</gui>, choose two of its dates, or two of
    its amounts, and click <gui>Calculate</gui> to see the difference: for
    instance how many days passed between printing and payment.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Items</gui></title>
    <p>Every line, including deleted ones marked <gui>Canceled</gui>, and the
    serial numbers sold on it.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Preview</gui></title>
    <p>The invoice as it was printed when posted.</p></item>
  </terms>

</page>
